  "title": "Neo-Concept International Group Holdings Limited Announces Closing of Approximately US$8.1 Million Public Offering of Class A Ordinary Shares",
  "summary": "Hong Kong, Feb. 11, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Neo-Concept International Group Holdings Limited (Nasdaq: NCI) (the “Company”), a one-stop apparel solution services provider, today announced the closing of its public offering on February 11, 2026 of 14,850,000 Class A ordinary shares at a public offering price of $0.5454 per Class A ordinary share (the “Offering”). […]",
